  "usage": [
    "The measure word '隻' (zek3) is used to count animals and some single objects.",
    "You put '隻' before the noun to show how many animals or certain items you are talking about.",
    "It works like 'a' or 'an' in English when referring to individual animals.",
    "'隻' is often used with birds, dogs, cats, and also with one of a pair like a single shoe."
  ],
